8<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Anti-acid<\/td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Good<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Anti-alkali<\/td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Excellent<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Anti-abrasion<\/td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Excellent<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Hydrolysis stability<\/td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Middle<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3>Post-Treatment<\/h3><p>For PPS filter bags, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28dcb59 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"28dcb59\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3398ee0 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3398ee0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Anti-Static-\u8be6\u60c56.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3096\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Anti-Static-\u8be6\u60c56.jpg 200w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Anti-Static-\u8be6\u60c56-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Anti-Static-\u8be6\u60c56-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Anti-Static (line type, cross line type, blend type)<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\